<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">In
addition, if (x) <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightReasonForIssuingToNonemployees_c20260101__20260630__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonClassAMember_zbF93wvpsgo6" title="Description of warrant or right issued"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2026-01-012026-06-30_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember" id="Fact000650" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightReasonForIssuingToNonemployees">the Company issues additional Class A ordinary shares or equity-linked securities for capital raising purposes in connection
