share (with such issue price or effective issue price to be determined in good faith by the Company&#8217;s board of directors and, in
the case of any such issuance to the Company&#8217;s initial shareholders or their affiliates, without taking into account any founder
shares held by the initial shareholders or such affiliates, as applicable, prior to such issuance) (the &#8220;Newly Issued Price&#8221;),
(y) the aggregate gross proceeds from such issuances represent more than 60% of the total equity proceeds (including from such issuances
and the Initial Public Offering), and interest thereon, available for the funding of the Company&#8217;s initial Business Combination
on the date of the consummation of the initial Business Combination (net of redemptions), and (z) the volume weighted average trading
