consummates its initial Business Combination (such price, the &#8220;Market Value&#8221;) is below $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1_iI_pid_c20260630__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonClassAMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MaximumMember_zMJFpGHXPHCh" title="Warrant exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_srt_MaximumMember" id="Fact000654" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">9.20</ix:nonFraction></span> per share, then the exercise
price of the warrants will be adjusted (to the nearest cent) to be equal to 115% of the higher of the Market Value and the Newly Issued
