$<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--SharesIssuedPricePerShare_iI_pid_c20250818__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonClassBMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--SponsorsMember_zjO7cn2TK4Q2"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" contextRef="AsOf2025-08-18_us-gaap_CommonClassBMember_custom_SponsorsMember" id="Fact000677" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.004</ix:nonFraction></span> per share, to cover certain of the Company&#8217;s expenses. Up to <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesShareBasedCompensationForfeited_pid_c20250818__20250818__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--OverAllotmentOptionMember__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonClassBMember_zUNg4c3IuHdf"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesShareBasedCompensationForfeited" contextRef="From2025-08-182025-08-18_us-gaap_OverAllotmentOptionMember_us-gaap_CommonClassBMember" id="Fact000678" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">750,000</ix:nonFraction></span> of the founder shares were subject to surrender by
