<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
January 22, 2026, the Sponsor granted membership interests equivalent to an aggregate of <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--CommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuance_iI_pid_c20260122__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__custom--FounderSharesMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--DirectorMember_zLTLCphvilz" title="Aggregate of shares granted"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuance" contextRef="AsOf2026-01-22_custom_FounderSharesMember_srt_DirectorMember" id="Fact000683" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">160,000</ix:nonFraction></span> founder shares to the independent directors
of the Company. The membership interests in founder shares granted to the independent directors are in the scope of FASB ASC Topic 718.
Under FASB ASC Topic 718, stock-based compensation associated with equity-classified awards is measured at fair value on the assignment
date. The founder shares have an aggregate fair value of $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--FairValueOptionAggregateDifferencesLongTermDebtInstruments_iI_c20260122__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__custom--FounderSharesMember_ziaogDnNa8x5" title="Shares aggregate fair value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:FairValueOptionAggregateDifferencesLongTermDebtInstruments" contextRef="AsOf2026-01-22_custom_FounderSharesMember" id="Fact000685" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">393,600</ix:nonFraction></span> or $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--SharesIssuedPricePerShare_iI_pid_c20260122__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__custom--FounderSharesMember_zCcUnoryNNs3" title="Shares aggregate per shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" contextRef="AsOf2026-01-22_custom_FounderSharesMember" id="Fact000687" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">2.46</ix:nonFraction></span> per share. The Company recognized stock-based compensation
