of record of the Company&#8217;s Class A ordinary shares and Class B ordinary shares are entitled to <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--CommonStockVotingRights_c20260101__20260630__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonClassAMember_zHtDs7yz7Vd7" title="Common stock voting rights"><span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--CommonStockVotingRights_c20260101__20260630__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonClassBMember_zDkjqIuA8u92" title="Common stock voting rights"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2026-01-012026-06-30_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember" id="Fact000797" name="us-gaap:CommonStockVotingRights"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2026-01-012026-06-30_us-gaap_CommonClassBMember" id="Fact000799" name="us-gaap:CommonStockVotingRights">one vote for each share held on
all matters to be voted on by shareholders.</ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></span></span></span></p>

