10 &#8212; <span id="xdx_821_zdxYQGKRs4A2">Subsequent Events</span></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Company evaluated subsequent events and transactions that occurred after the balance sheet date up to the date that the unaudited condensed
financial statements were available to be issued. Based upon this review, the Company did not identify any subsequent events that would
have required adjustment or disclosure in the unaudited condensed financial statements.</span></p>

